{
  "id": "bs-k12-integral-sulit-07",
  "nama": "Bank Soal Sulit - Paket 7",
  "kelas": 12,
  "kategori": "Integral Fungsi",
  "tingkat": "SULIT",
  "deskripsi": "Aplikasi Integral: Analisis Grafik",
  "versi": "1.0.1",
  "soal": [
    {
      "id": "bs-k12-integral-sulit-07-q01",
      "pertanyaan": [
        { "tipe": "paragraph", "text": "Luas daerah yang diarsir pada gambar dapat dinyatakan dengan rumus..." },
        {
          "tipe": "image",
          "src": "images/kelas12/integral/sulit/grafik-akar-garis.png",
          "caption": "Grafik kurva y = akar(2x) dan garis x - y = 4. Daerah yang diarsir berada di antara kurva dan garis pada kuadran I.",
          "width": "medium"
        }
      ],
      "pilihan": [
        [{"tipe":"paragraph","text":"$\\int_{0}^{8} \\sqrt{2x} \\, dx - \\int_{4}^{8} (x-4) \\, dx$"}],
        [{"tipe":"paragraph","text":"$\\int_{0}^{8} \\sqrt{2x} \\, dx + \\int_{4}^{8} (x-4) \\, dx$"}],
        [{"tipe":"paragraph","text":"$\\int_{0}^{8} (x-4) \\, dx - \\int_{0}^{8} \\sqrt{2x} \\, dx$"}],
        [{"tipe":"paragraph","text":"$\\int_{0}^{8} (\\sqrt{2x} - x + 4) \\, dx$"}],
        [{"tipe":"paragraph","text":"$\\int_{0}^{4} \\sqrt{2x} \\, dx + \\int_{4}^{8} (\\sqrt{2x} - x + 4) \\, dx$"}]
      ],
      "jawaban_benar": 0,
      "pembahasan": [
        { "tipe": "paragraph", "text": "Garis $x - y = 4 \\Rightarrow y = x - 4$. Kurva $y = \\sqrt{2x}$. Titik potong: $\\sqrt{2x} = x - 4 \\Rightarrow 2x = x^2 - 8x + 16 \\Rightarrow x^2 - 10x + 16 = 0 \\Rightarrow x=2$ atau $x=8$." },
        { "tipe": "paragraph", "text": "Berdasarkan gambar, daerah dibatasi oleh kurva (atas) dari $x=0$ sampai $x=8$ dan garis (bawah) dari $x=4$ sampai $x=8$. Maka rumusnya adalah $\\int_{0}^{8} \\sqrt{2x} \\, dx - \\int_{4}^{8} (x-4) \\, dx$." }
      ],
      "tingkat": "SULIT"
    },
    {
      "id": "bs-k12-integral-sulit-07-q02",
      "pertanyaan": [
        { "tipe": "paragraph", "text": "Luas daerah yang diarsir pada gambar berikut dapat dinyatakan dengan rumus..." },
        {
          "tipe": "image",
          "src": "images/kelas12/integral/sulit/grafik-sin-cos.png",
          "caption": "Grafik kurva y = cos x dan y = sin 2x pada interval 0 sampai pi/2. Daerah yang diarsir dibatasi oleh kedua kurva tersebut.",
          "width": "medium"
        }
      ],
      "pilihan": [
        [{"tipe":"paragraph","text":"$\\int_{\\pi/6}^{\\pi/2} (\\cos x - \\sin 2x) \\, dx$"}],
        [{"tipe":"paragraph","text":"$\\int_{0}^{\\pi/6} (\\sin 2x - \\cos x) \\, dx$"}],
        [{"tipe":"paragraph","text":"$\\int_{0}^{\\pi/2} (\\cos x - \\sin 2x) \\, dx$"}],
        [{"tipe":"paragraph","text":"$\\int_{0}^{\\pi/6} (\\cos x - \\sin 2x) \\, dx$"}],
        [{"tipe":"paragraph","text":"$\\int_{\\pi/6}^{\\pi/2} (\\sin 2x - \\cos x) \\, dx$"}]
      ],
      "jawaban_benar": 0,
      "pembahasan": [
        { "tipe": "paragraph", "text": "Titik potong: $\\cos x = \\sin 2x = 2\\sin x \\cos x \\Rightarrow \\cos x(1 - 2\\sin x) = 0 \\Rightarrow \\sin x = 1/2 \\Rightarrow x = \\pi/6$." },
        { "tipe": "paragraph", "text": "Pada interval $[\\pi/6, \\pi/2]$, kurva $y = \\cos x$ berada di atas $y = \\sin 2x$. Jadi rumusnya $\\int_{\\pi/6}^{\\pi/2} (\\cos x - \\sin 2x) \\, dx$." }
      ],
      "tingkat": "SULIT"
    },
    {
      "id": "bs-k12-integral-sulit-07-q03",
      "pertanyaan": [
        { "tipe": "paragraph", "text": "Luas daerah yang diarsir pada gambar dapat dinyatakan dengan rumus..." },
        {
          "tipe": "image",
          "src": "images/kelas12/integral/sulit/grafik-parabola-garis-2.png",
          "caption": "Grafik kurva y = x^2 dan garis y = x + 2. Daerah yang diarsir berada di antara kurva dan garis pada kuadran I dan II.",
          "width": "medium"
        }
      ],
      "pilihan": [
        [{"tipe":"paragraph","text":"$\\int_{-1}^{2} ((x+2) - x^2) \\, dx$"}],
        [{"tipe":"paragraph","text":"$\\int_{-1}^{2} (x^2 - (x+2)) \\, dx$"}],
        [{"tipe":"paragraph","text":"$\\int_{-2}^{1} ((x+2) - x^2) \\, dx$"}],
        [{"tipe":"paragraph","text":"$\\int_{-1}^{2} (x^2 + x + 2) \\, dx$"}],
        [{"tipe":"paragraph","text":"$\\int_{0}^{2} ((x+2) - x^2) \\, dx$"}]
      ],
      "jawaban_benar": 0,
      "pembahasan": [
        { "tipe": "paragraph", "text": "Titik potong: $x^2 = x + 2 \\Rightarrow x^2 - x - 2 = 0 \\Rightarrow (x-2)(x+1)=0 \\Rightarrow x=-1, x=2$." },
        { "tipe": "paragraph", "text": "Garis berada di atas kurva, sehingga luas = $\\int_{-1}^{2} ((x+2) - x^2) \\, dx$." }
      ],
      "tingkat": "SULIT"
    },
    {
      "id": "bs-k12-integral-sulit-07-q04",
      "pertanyaan": [
        { "tipe": "paragraph", "text": "Luas daerah yang dibatasi oleh kurva $y = x^2$ dan garis $y = 5x - 4$ adalah ..." }
      ],
      "pilihan": [
        [{"tipe":"paragraph","text":"$\\dfrac{9}{2}$"}],
        [{"tipe":"paragraph","text":"$\\dfrac{11}{6}$"}],
        [{"tipe":"paragraph","text":"$\\dfrac{8}{3}$"}],
        [{"tipe":"paragraph","text":"$\\dfrac{11}{2}$"}],
        [{"tipe":"paragraph","text":"$\\dfrac{15}{2}$"}]
      ],
      "jawaban_benar": 0,
      "pembahasan": [
        { "tipe": "paragraph", "text": "Titik potong: $x^2 = 5x - 4 \\Rightarrow x^2 - 5x + 4 = 0 \\Rightarrow x=1, x=4$." },
        { "tipe": "formula_block", "latex": "L = \\int_{1}^{4} ((5x-4) - x^2) \\, dx = [\\dfrac{5}{2}x^2 - 4x - \\dfrac{1}{3}x^3]_{1}^{4}" },
        { "tipe": "formula_block", "latex": "= (40 - 16 - \\dfrac{64}{3}) - (2.5 - 4 - \\dfrac{1}{3}) = \\dfrac{8}{3} - (-\\dfrac{11}{6}) = \\dfrac{27}{6} = \\dfrac{9}{2}" }
      ],
      "tingkat": "SULIT"
    },
    {
      "id": "bs-k12-integral-sulit-07-q05",
      "pertanyaan": [
        { "tipe": "paragraph", "text": "Volume benda putar yang dibatasi oleh kurva $y = \\sqrt{x}$, sumbu-$x$, garis $x = 1$, dan garis $x = 4$ diputar mengelilingi sumbu-$x$ adalah ..." }
      ],
      "pilihan": [
        [{"tipe":"paragraph","text":"$\\dfrac{15}{2}\\pi$"}],
        [{"tipe":"paragraph","text":"$\\dfrac{7}{2}\\pi$"}],
        [{"tipe":"paragraph","text":"$\\dfrac{5}{2}\\pi$"}],
        [{"tipe":"paragraph","text":"$\\dfrac{3}{2}\\pi$"}],
        [{"tipe":"paragraph","text":"$12\\pi$"}]
      ],
      "jawaban_benar": 0,
      "pembahasan": [
        { "tipe": "formula_block", "latex": "V = \\pi \\int_{1}^{4} (\\sqrt{x})^2 \\, dx = \\pi \\int_{1}^{4} x \\, dx = \\pi [\\dfrac{1}{2}x^2]_{1}^{4} = \\pi(8 - 0.5) = \\dfrac{15}{2}\\pi" }
      ],
      "tingkat": "SULIT"
    },
    {
      "id": "bs-k12-integral-sulit-07-q06",
      "pertanyaan": [
        { "tipe": "paragraph", "text": "Luas daerah yang dibatasi oleh parabola $y = 4x - x^2$, garis $y = -2x + 8$, dan sumbu-$Y$ adalah ..." }
      ],
      "pilihan": [
        [{"tipe":"paragraph","text":"$6\\dfrac{2}{3}$"}],
        [{"tipe":"paragraph","text":"$4\\dfrac{2}{3}$"}],
        [{"tipe":"paragraph","text":"$12\\dfrac{2}{3}$"}],
        [{"tipe":"paragraph","text":"$20\\dfrac{2}{3}$"}],
        [{"tipe":"paragraph","text":"$10\\dfrac{1}{3}$"}]
      ],
      "jawaban_benar": 0,
      "pembahasan": [
        { "tipe": "paragraph", "text": "Titik potong parabola dan garis: $4x-x^2 = -2x+8 \\Rightarrow x^2-6x+8=0 \\Rightarrow x=2, x=4$. Batas sumbu-Y adalah $x=0$." },
        { "tipe": "paragraph", "text": "Pada interval $0 \\le x \\le 2$, garis $y = -2x+8$ berada di atas parabola $y = 4x-x^2$." },
        { "tipe": "formula_block", "latex": "L = \\int_{0}^{2} ((-2x+8) - (4x-x^2)) \\, dx = \\int_{0}^{2} (x^2-6x+8) \\, dx" },
        { "tipe": "formula_block", "latex": "= [\\dfrac{1}{3}x^3 - 3x^2 + 8x]_{0}^{2} = \\dfrac{8}{3} - 12 + 16 = \\dfrac{20}{3} = 6\\dfrac{2}{3}" }
      ],
      "tingkat": "SULIT"
    },
    {
      "id": "bs-k12-integral-sulit-07-q07",
      "pertanyaan": [
        { "tipe": "paragraph", "text": "Volume benda putar yang terjadi jika daerah yang dibatasi oleh kurva $y = 2x^2$ dan $y = 4x$ bila diputar mengelilingi sumbu-$X$ sejauh $360^\\circ$ adalah ..." }
      ],
      "pilihan": [
        [{"tipe":"paragraph","text":"$\\dfrac{256}{15}\\pi$"}],
        [{"tipe":"paragraph","text":"$\\dfrac{256}{18}\\pi$"}],
        [{"tipe":"paragraph","text":"$\\dfrac{320}{15}\\pi$"}],
        [{"tipe":"paragraph","text":"$\\dfrac{265}{15}\\pi$"}],
        [{"tipe":"paragraph","text":"$\\dfrac{320}{18}\\pi$"}]
      ],
      "jawaban_benar": 0,
      "pembahasan": [
        { "tipe": "paragraph", "text": "Titik potong: $2x^2 = 4x \\Rightarrow 2x(x-2)=0 \\Rightarrow x=0, x=2$." },
        { "tipe": "formula_block", "latex": "V = \\pi \\int_{0}^{2} [(4x)^2 - (2x^2)^2] \\, dx = \\pi \\int_{0}^{2} (16x^2 - 4x^4) \\, dx" },
        { "tipe": "formula_block", "latex": "= \\pi [\\dfrac{16}{3}x^3 - \\dfrac{4}{5}x^5]_{0}^{2} = \\pi (\\dfrac{128}{3} - \\dfrac{128}{5}) = 128\\pi(\\dfrac{2}{15}) = \\dfrac{256}{15}\\pi" }
      ],
      "tingkat": "SULIT"
    },
    {
      "id": "bs-k12-integral-sulit-07-q08",
      "pertanyaan": [
        { "tipe": "paragraph", "text": "Volume benda putar yang terbentuk dari daerah yang dibatasi oleh kurva $x = \\sqrt{3}y^2$, lingkaran $x^2 + y^2 = 4$ dan sumbu-$X$, diputar mengelilingi sumbu-$Y$ adalah ..." }
      ],
      "pilihan": [
        [{"tipe":"paragraph","text":"$\\dfrac{46}{15}\\pi$"}],
        [{"tipe":"paragraph","text":"$\\dfrac{16}{15}\\pi$"}],
        [{"tipe":"paragraph","text":"$\\dfrac{34}{15}\\pi$"}],
        [{"tipe":"paragraph","text":"$\\dfrac{32}{15}\\pi$"}],
        [{"tipe":"paragraph","text":"$\\dfrac{40}{15}\\pi$"}]
      ],
      "jawaban_benar": 0,
      "pembahasan": [
        { "tipe": "paragraph", "text": "Titik potong: $(\\sqrt{3}y^2)^2 + y^2 = 4 \\Rightarrow 3y^4 + y^2 - 4 = 0 \\Rightarrow (3y^2+4)(y^2-1)=0 \\Rightarrow y=1$." },
        { "tipe": "paragraph", "text": "Volume = $\\pi \\int_{0}^{1} [(\\sqrt{4-y^2})^2 - (\\sqrt{3}y^2)^2] \\, dy = \\pi \\int_{0}^{1} (4 - y^2 - 3y^4) \\, dy$." },
        { "tipe": "formula_block", "latex": "= \\pi [4y - \\dfrac{1}{3}y^3 - \\dfrac{3}{5}y^5]_{0}^{1} = \\pi(4 - \\dfrac{1}{3} - \\dfrac{3}{5}) = \\pi(\\dfrac{60-5-9}{15}) = \\dfrac{46}{15}\\pi" }
      ],
      "tingkat": "SULIT"
    },
    {
      "id": "bs-k12-integral-sulit-07-q09",
      "pertanyaan": [
        { "tipe": "paragraph", "text": "Daerah yang dibatasi oleh kurva $y = x^2$ dan garis $x + y - 2 = 0$ diputar mengelilingi sumbu-$X$. Volume benda putar yang terjadi adalah ..." }
      ],
      "pilihan": [
        [{"tipe":"paragraph","text":"$14\\dfrac{2}{5}\\pi$"}],
        [{"tipe":"paragraph","text":"$\\dfrac{72}{5}\\pi$"}],
        [{"tipe":"paragraph","text":"$15\\dfrac{2}{3}\\pi$"}],
        [{"tipe":"paragraph","text":"$10\\dfrac{3}{5}\\pi$"}],
        [{"tipe":"paragraph","text":"$\\dfrac{32}{5}\\pi$"}]
      ],
      "jawaban_benar": 0,
      "pembahasan": [
        { "tipe": "paragraph", "text": "Garis $y = -x + 2$. Titik potong: $x^2 = -x + 2 \\Rightarrow x^2+x-2=0 \\Rightarrow x=1, x=-2$." },
        { "tipe": "formula_block", "latex": "V = \\pi \\int_{-2}^{1} [(-x+2)^2 - (x^2)^2] \\, dx = \\pi \\int_{-2}^{1} (x^2 - 4x + 4 - x^4) \\, dx" },
        { "tipe": "formula_block", "latex": "= \\pi [\\dfrac{1}{3}x^3 - 2x^2 + 4x - \\dfrac{1}{5}x^5]_{-2}^{1} = \\pi [\\dfrac{32}{15} - (-\\dfrac{184}{15})] = \\dfrac{216}{15}\\pi = \\dfrac{72}{5}\\pi = 14\\dfrac{2}{5}\\pi" }
      ],
      "tingkat": "SULIT"
    },
    {
      "id": "bs-k12-integral-sulit-07-q10",
      "pertanyaan": [
        { "tipe": "paragraph", "text": "Luas daerah yang dibatasi oleh kurva $y = x^2$ dan garis $x + y = 6$ adalah ..." }
      ],
      "pilihan": [
        [{"tipe":"paragraph","text":"$\\dfrac{125}{6}$"}],
        [{"tipe":"paragraph","text":"$54$"}],
        [{"tipe":"paragraph","text":"$\\dfrac{44}{6}$"}],
        [{"tipe":"paragraph","text":"$18$"}],
        [{"tipe":"paragraph","text":"$\\dfrac{32}{3}$"}]
      ],
      "jawaban_benar": 0,
      "pembahasan": [
        { "tipe": "paragraph", "text": "Garis $y = -x + 6$. Titik potong: $x^2 = -x+6 \\Rightarrow x^2+x-6=0 \\Rightarrow x=-3, x=2$." },
        { "tipe": "formula_block", "latex": "L = \\int_{-3}^{2} ((-x+6) - x^2) \\, dx = [-\\dfrac{1}{3}x^3 - \\dfrac{1}{2}x^2 + 6x]_{-3}^{2}" },
        { "tipe": "formula_block", "latex": "= (-\\dfrac{8}{3} - 2 + 12) - (9 - 4.5 - 18) = (\\dfrac{22}{3}) - (-13.5) = \\dfrac{22}{3} + \\dfrac{27}{2} = \\dfrac{125}{6}" }
      ],
      "tingkat": "SULIT"
    }
  ]
}
